SUMMARY:Davis Youth Choir Fall Registration
DESCRIPTION:Fall Registration for the Davis Youth Choir is now open; singing for ages five through high school! \nThe Davis Youth Choir is made up of three choirs: Hummingbird (Kindergarten to 2nd Grade)\, Lark (3rd to 9th Grade)\, and Bel Canto (7th grade to 12th grade\, advanced skills). Rehearsals begin the week of September 9th. Openings are limited\, so those who are interested in participating are strongly encouraged to reserve their place in the choir. \nSliding scale tuition available with support from the Davis Odd Fellows Encampment and Soroptimist International Club of Davis\, who believe in youth and music!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/davis-youth-choir-fall-registration/
LOCATION:online
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Music,Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/DYC-fall-2026-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
